<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-DUTCH WIN CHAMPIONS TROPHY.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-DUTCH WIN CHAMPIONS TROPHY.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands won the Champions Trophy hockey tournament when they beat Pakistan 3-2 in the final on Sunday.  </p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Netherlands beat Pakistan 3-2 (3-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Netherlands - Tean de Nooijer (9th), Van Pelt Wouter (13th), Bran Lomans (20th).</p>
<p>Pakistan - Rahim Khan (25th), Mohammad Usman (28th)</p>
